[6.927, "o", "# Release readiness: product `rr-product-92689-18478`\r\n\r\nGenerated: 2026-08-29T18:55:18Z\r\n\r\n## Scope and rules\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Product scope; collection started 2026-08-29T18:55:18Z and ended 2026-08-29T18:55:25Z; 3 visible bugs. Bounded sample: #232, #233, #234. Source: `product-scope`; bounded rolling collection.\r\n- **Assumption:** `RESOLVED` and `CLOSED` are complete. `Highest` priority or literal `release-blocker` whiteboard text is release-blocking; there are no severity, keyword, flag, or custom-field blocker rules.\r\n- **Assumption:** Dependency and stale checks are selected as non-blocking risks. Dependency targets in `RESOLVED` or `CLOSED` are complete with no resolved-target override. Stale means changed before 2026-07-30T18:55:18Z (30 days before `as-of`); UTC is the release-policy time zone.\r\n- **Assumption:** Deadline, ownership, milestone, status/resolution, and history/regression checks are not selected. This is a complete zero-offset review, the root cap is 100, and Markdown is the requested art"]
[0.000, "o", "ifact.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** Authorization can hide bugs, so this report does not claim an unobservable total.\r\n\r\n## Readiness assessment\r\n\r\n- **Assessment:** not ready.\r\n- **Fact:** 1/3 visible bugs match a configured blocker. Bounded sample: #234. Source: `product-scope`.\r\n\r\n## Blockers\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n- **Fact:** #234 is open with `Highest` priority and the configured whiteboard marker. Source: `product-scope`.\r\n\r\n## Dependency risks\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** 1/1 visible outgoing dependencies are unresolved. Bounded sample: #232. Source: `dependency-links`. It affects #234.\r\n\r\n## Stale or unowned work\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** 0/3 visible bugs are stale under the stated assumptions. Bounded sample: (none). Source: `product-scope`.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** Ownership check: N/A (not selected).\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
