[0.000, "o", "\r\n## Decisions needed\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Assessment:** Decide whether #234 can be cleared and whether dependency #232 must close before the release proceeds.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Data limitations\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** Rolling snapshot, visible rows only. Deadline, ownership, milestone, status/resolution, history/regression, and custom-field evidence is N/A because those checks were not selected. Alternate saved-query, URL, milestone, and version reads verify the fixture only; the assessment uses the product scope alone.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n## Source commands\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "```text\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[marker-discovery] bzr --server <server-profile> --json bug list --whiteboard bzr-release-readiness-demo-v1 --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,product,version,target_milestone,whiteboard\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[root-detail] bzr --server <server-profile> --json bug view 234 --fields id,product,version,target_milestone,whiteboard\r\n[url-query-preflight] bzr --server <server-profile> --json query show release-readiness-demo-url\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[saved-query-preflight] bzr --server <server-profile> --json query show release-readiness-demo\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[custom-scope-check] bzr --server <server-profile> --json bug search --from-url <credential-free-url> --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,depends_on,last_change_time,whiteboard\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[saved-scope-check] bzr --server <server-profile> --json query run release-readiness-demo --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,depends_on,last_change_time,whiteboard\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[milestone-scope-check] bzr --server <server-profile> --json bug list --product rr-product-92689-18478 --target-milestone=--- --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,depends_on,last_change_time,whiteboard\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[version-scope-check] bzr --server <server-profile> --json bug list --version rr-version-92689-2549 --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,depends_on,last_change_time,whiteboard\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[product-scope] bzr --server <server-profile> --json bug list --product rr-product-92689-18478 --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,depends_on,last_change_time,whiteboard\r\n"]
